  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 627c1c2bfea08a54997d89f353dc3858, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  setEvents:
    events:
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Now you need to collect scroll before taking the quiz
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 40635625}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1070087906}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 49848165}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 897200753}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Bayani, narating natin ang yugto ng pagbalik-loob at muling pagtindig.
            Sa mga kabanatang ito, makikita natin ang pakikibaka ng bayan sa ilalim
            ng pang-aapi
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 40635625}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1070087906}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 49848165}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 49848165}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa ikawalong antas ng ating paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere, ang muling
            pag-asa sa kabila ng trahedya, at ang katatagan ng mga tauhan na naninindigan
            sa tama at makatarungan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 40635625}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1070087906}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 49848165}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: e80b70e9b96d60c40acd329aad574df9, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Matapos ang matinding pagsubok, si Ibarra ay muling bumalik upang
            ipagpatuloy ang kanyang adhikain. Ang eksenang ito ay sumisimbolo ng
            panibagong pag-asa at determinasyon na baguhin ang lipunan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 86337742408d7c1428bf192880cca7fe, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang mga simpleng tao ay nagsimulang kilalanin ang kanilang kapangyarihan
            sa lipunan. Ang pagtutulungan at sakripisyo ng masa ay nagiging pundasyon
            ng tunay na pagbabago.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 1d4c0c9d9e7c92b4895dbf6603bdfe09, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang alaala ni Elias ay nananatili sa puso ng mga tao bilang inspirasyon
            ng kabayanihan. Ipinapakita nito na kahit wala na ang isang bayani, ang
            kanyang prinsipyo ay patuloy na humuhubog sa bayan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 40635625}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1070087906}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 49848165}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: This is the end of our discussion
        - characterObj: {fileID: 897200753}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Now you must search for 10 hidden scrolls. Each scroll contains
            trivia from Chapters 53 to 60. Collect them all, and you will unlock
            the quiz to prove what you\u2019ve learned"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 40635625}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
